{"html": "<div  id=\"content\" class=\"site-content\">\n\t\t<div  class=\"tema-container\">\n\t\t\n\n\t<div id=\"primary\" class=\"content-area primary\">\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<main id=\"main\" class=\"site-main\">\n\t\t\t\t<article\nclass=\"page type-page status-publish has-post-thumbnail tema-article-single\" id=\"entrada-213\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/CreativeWork\" itemscope=\"itemscope\">\n\t\n\t\t\t\t<header class=\"entry-header tema-no-thumbnail tema-no-title tema-header-without-markup\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</header> \n\t\t\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\"\n\titemprop=\"text\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\t<div data-bl-type=\"s-page\" data-bl-id=\"213\" class=\"bl bl-213\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"bl-section bl-element bl-element-211b2901 bl-section-boxed\" data-id=\"211b2901\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-container bl-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-column bl-col-50 bl-element\" data-id=\"6ae0b3fc\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-widget-wrap bl-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-element bl-element-101e443f bl-widget bl-widget-heading\" data-id=\"101e443f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"bl-heading-title bl-size-default\">Preguntas frecuentes</h1>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-element bl-widget bl-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6eb965e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bl-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Si tienes cualquier duda sobre lo que Gespymes puede ofrecerte, no dudes en ponerte en contacto con nosotros, estaremos encantados de resolver tus dudas.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div